      "text": "CRANMER.\n[Kneeling.] And to your royal Grace and the good Queen,\nMy noble partners and myself thus pray\nAll comfort, joy, in this most gracious lady\nHeaven ever laid up to make parents happy\nMay hourly fall upon ye!",
